guarded formula characterizing all counter-examples:
"∃ B bid rst #i.
  (SealBatchEvent( B, bid, rst ) @ #i)
 ∧
  ((∀ idx A c #j.
     (Slot1Added( B, bid, rst, idx, A, c ) @ #j) ⇒ ¬(#j < #i)) ∨
   (∀ idx A c #j.
     (Slot2Added( B, bid, rst, idx, A, c ) @ #j) ⇒ ¬(#j < #i)) ∨
   (∀ idx A c #j.
     (Slot3Added( B, bid, rst, idx, A, c ) @ #j) ⇒ ¬(#j < #i)) ∨
   (∀ idx A c #j.
     (Slot4Added( B, bid, rst, idx, A, c ) @ #j) ⇒ ¬(#j < #i)))"
*/
by sorry

